                <h3 class="card-link-title">Where is the data stored?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">On EU servers in Germany, with Hetzner, and built to be GDPR-aligned. The same hosting applies for teams working in Singapore. The structured record lives on Quickler's dashboard, not scattered across personal phones.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Is the WhatsApp message the record?</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">No. WhatsApp is only how a worker answers. Quickler turns those answers into a structured digital record on the dashboard, with a PDF you can export when a document is needed. The dashboard entry is the authoritative copy.</p>
            </article>
